{"meta":{"id":"compile-vs-runtime","category":"it/syntax/java/compile","title":"컴파일 시점 vs 실행 시점 · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"javac 가 막는 오류(checked 예외, 타입) 와 JVM 실행 중 오류, 타입 소거","tags":["java","f-compile","f-runtime"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">컴파일 시점 vs 실행 시점 · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> javac 가 막는 오류(checked 예외, 타입) 와 JVM 실행 중 오류, 타입 소거</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">컴파일 시점 (javac)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">타입 불일치, 없는 메서드 호출, final 재할당</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">checked 예외(IOException 등) 처리 누락 — try/catch 또는 throws 필수</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">제네릭 타입 검사 — 컴파일 후 타입 정보는 지워짐(타입 소거)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">sealed switch 의 모든 경우 처리 여부</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 시점 (JVM)</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">NullPointerException, ClassCastException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException (unchecked 예외)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">private · final 은 실행 시점에도 유지 (TS 의 private 와 다름)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-rose-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">instanceof — 클래스 · interface 모두 실행 중 확인 가능</span></div></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">List raw = new ArrayList&lt;String&gt;();\r\nraw.add(10);                         // 경고만 — 타입 소거로 실행 중에는 막지 못함\r\nString s = (String) raw.get(0);      // 실행 시 ClassCastException</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 컴파일 시점에만 검사되는 제한 — TS 는 타입이 모두 지워지고, Java 는 클래스 정보가 남는다</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/compile/compile-vs-runtime","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"compile","title":"컴파일","path":"it/syntax/java/compile"}],"hasImage":false}